  "title": "Old-Fashioned Lemon Pie",
  "description": "This lemon pie recipe with meringue makes a luscious lemon filling from scratch in a double boiler with fresh lemon juice and grated lemon zest.",
  "authors": [
    "Pat"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-02-17T15:57:06-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-02-15T18:12:39-05:00",
